{"chapter": "topologies", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "020N", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:86ec2eecd570d0c8a4f479624baf284069e51967c1f2fc353abd21054aea9915", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a1e4610d8cc146b2419cb980dfe9ba08e72db9e75ebbf7df7d74654f0703f0fe", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet us check that the notion of a sheaf on the small Zariski site\ncorresponds to notion of a sheaf on <MATH_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:75a24480e26b711d50ef11b9611a93fadf1e054cfec1af7032b1980372a67344", "unit_id": "tag:020N:prose-0006"}
